WEBVTT

00:08:59.075 --> 00:09:01.104
might be a problem,

00:09:01.104 --> 00:09:03.742
the next question is, what do you do about it?

00:09:03.742 --> 00:09:08.198
And my answer, in a word, is mindfulness.

00:09:08.198 --> 00:09:10.733
I'm not saying you need to learn to meditate

00:09:10.733 --> 00:09:12.725
or take up yoga.

00:09:12.725 --> 00:09:15.277
I'm talking about mindful eating:

00:09:15.277 --> 00:09:18.785
learning to understand your body's signals

00:09:18.785 --> 00:09:21.174
so that you eat when you're hungry

00:09:21.174 --> 00:09:23.516
and stop when you're full,

00:09:23.516 --> 00:09:25.694
because a lot of weight gain boils down

00:09:25.694 --> 00:09:28.760
to eating when you're not hungry.

00:09:28.760 --> 00:09:30.244
How do you do it?